OL,3,GNEWSAHow a hit-and-run led to a labour
OL,4,Aof love for maps artist
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Joshua Tabti found himself
OL,7,Fhousebound while recovering from a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run crash in 2019, he decided
OL,9,Fto finally take on a project he had
OL,10,Fbeen putting off - with Middle-earth as
OL,11,Fhis inspiration.
OL,13,F"I really wanted to draw a map of
OL,14,FIceland, where I used to live - I
OL,15,Fworked there for a year as a glacier
OL,16,Fguide," explains the 32-year-old from
OL,17,Fhis studio on a drizzly Tuesday
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
