OL,3,GNEWSAHow a hit-and-run led to a labour
OL,4,Aof love for maps artist
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnable to continue in his job as a
OL,7,Fclimbing instructor due to his
OL,8,Finjuries, Joshua found a new purpose in
OL,9,Fcartography, which has since become his
OL,10,Fcareer.
OL,12,F"Making maps is the main passion. I
OL,13,Fstudied art at university. I also
OL,14,Freally love geography, language and
OL,15,Fhistory," he says.
